Word list attribution
======================

The file words.txt in this directory is derived from:

    Title:   EFF's "large" wordlist for passphrases (eff_large_wordlist.txt)
    Author:  Electronic Frontier Foundation (Joseph Bonneau)
    Source:  https://www.eff.org/dice
    License: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 United States (CC BY 3.0 US)
             https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/us/

Changes made:
    The original file lists each word preceded by a five-digit dice index
    (e.g. "16663  copilot"). This derivative strips the dice indices, keeps
    one word per line, removes entries containing non-letter characters, and
    sorts the result. The words themselves are unchanged.

This word list is licensed under CC BY 3.0 US and is used here under the terms
of that license. This attribution does not affect the MIT license that covers
the rest of this project (see ../LICENSE).
